Changes to ORB-SLAM3 (https://github.com/UZ-SLAMLab/ORB_SLAM3) for monocular map
building with per-frame keypoint masks and monocular localization against a saved
atlas. Applies to upstream V1.0, commit 4452a3c4ab75b1cde34e5505a36ec3f9edcdc4c4.
The changed files remain under the GNU General Public License v3 of ORB-SLAM3.
